== reference bands, same scene and camera ==
   known SAME occasion (one session)  n=5   SSIM 0.6269..0.9536  MAE 3.10..16.99
   known DIFFERENT occasion           n=16  SSIM 0.4453..0.5661  MAE 58.52..70.97
   separation SSIM: different <= 0.5661 < 0.6269 <= same
   separation MAE : same <= 16.99 < 58.52 <= different

   QUERY gopro_004 (test) vs gopro_005 (val):  SSIM 0.6828  MAE 38.08  RMSE 47.35  r 0.6299
   SSIM 0.6828 lies within the same-occasion band
   MAE  38.08 lies BETWEEN the bands, in the gap 16.99 to 58.52
   The two measures do not agree on placement. No verdict is drawn
   here; the occasion judgement is the author's.

